        "ios": {
          "status": "native-equivalent",
          "nativeEquivalenceNotes": "Combines an Apple cellular-path observer with packet-tunnel provider state and presents them as independent health tiles, matching Android's distinct cellular and relay visibility without coupling the two signals.",
